Error [E0078]: This finite value loop needs a written exhaustion route
  --> tests/ui/value_loop_exhaustion_route.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     }
    |     ^
 Why: The source can end without a matching break, so the expression must state what exhaustion means
 Fix: Add `?? fallback` after the closing `}`, or use the labeled loop form for `next` or `break`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0078

Error [E0078]: This finite value loop cannot use `?? next` after its closing brace
  --> tests/ui/value_loop_exhaustion_route.jet:15:10
    |
 15 |     } ?? next
    |          ^^^^
 Why: The route would control the loop that just closed; use a labeled loop to name the target
 Fix: Write a labeled search such as `found :: loop { ... break(found, value) }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0078

